+{
+  "description": "Token AI brings a local AI workspace to your iPhone. Download compatible models, choose the right one for your task, and keep your conversations organized in one place.\n\nCHAT AND CREATE\nAsk questions, draft writing, review code and explore ideas. Start a new conversation or return to a saved chat, with search and pinned conversations to help you find your work.\n\nVOICE AND VISION\nChoose a voice for spoken conversations. Use compatible vision models to work with photos and camera captures in Lens.\n\nYOUR MODEL LIBRARY\nBrowse available models, download compatible packs, import supported model files and manage the storage they use. Model availability depends on your iPhone and the model's requirements.\n\nIMAGE STUDIO\nCreate images using supported local image models. Image models are downloaded separately. Optional parental controls let a parent restrict image generation with a PIN.\n\nLOCAL API\nEnable the authenticated Local API Server to connect compatible tools on your trusted local network.\n\nLOCAL BY DEFAULT\nNo Token AI account is required. Conversations are stored on your device and compatible models run locally. Optional web tools send requests to the provider you configure. Optional iCloud conversation sync uses your private CloudKit database.\n\nRequires iOS 27 or later. Model files are downloaded separately and may require several gigabytes of storage. Available features, model compatibility and generation speed depend on your iPhone's memory, storage and thermal conditions. AI results can be inaccurate; review them before relying on them.",
+  "keywords": "offline,assistant,llm,chatbot,voice,vision,images,writing,coding,models,private,local,ai",
+  "marketingUrl": "https://mesut.uk/apps/token",
+  "promotionalText": "Make room for local AI. Chat, write, explore images and use voice on your iPhone, with downloadable models and optional network features.",
+  "supportUrl": "https://mesut.uk/apps/token/support",
+  "whatsNew": "• Added iPhone Duo support.\n• Token AI 2.0 brings chats, Lens, voice, models and Image Studio together in a new workspace.\n• Find saved conversations with search and pins, and manage compatible model downloads, imports and storage.\n• Choose voices for spoken conversations and work with photos or camera captures using supported vision models.\n• Create images with supported local models, with optional PIN-protected parental controls.\n• Connect compatible tools through the authenticated Local API Server on a trusted local network.\n• Optional iCloud conversation sync and separately controlled web tools."
+}
